==Strategy==
Meatshielding is useless, if not for the Shadow Boxer Ks and the Dark Otters. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera]] are... well, if you don't use them, you're going to have an awful experience. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] is a win/lose. You never know if he's going to attack in time. Consider also that he gets knocked back easily, so it's extremely dangerous to use him.

In fact, Gentleman Bros. attacks at a pretty slow rate, so this leaves you the Shadow Boxer Ks and the Dark Otters as main threats. Bring some meatshields to stop Gentleman Bros., then spam Cats that do good area damage to kill the Dark enemies. Having [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|dual]] [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFOs]], Jamiera Cat, [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cats]] will help you plenty. When the Dark enemies have been killed, take this opportunity to damage Gentleman Bros. Bring any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] with long range (longer than 500) that you have.

